I am moving one (1) day after I return from jbonunsla.  I start
packing today.  I am working full time in the mean time.  This move
involves three people and three houses (two being moved in to, one
being moved out of).

In addition, the gf that is not moving in with me is having serious
medical problems.

What little time I get for anything even vaguely self-oriented will
be going to video games, because they *lower* my stress level;
Lojban work with jbonunsla coming up and a troll sending me nasty
personal mails, not so much with the stress lowering.

In other words, please do not expect anything out of me until early
December.

I have added Bob to the lojban@lojban.org e-mail address so he can
keep up with book orders, and everyone on llg-board now has admin
access so they can approve non-member posts to the list.

I'll still be online during PST (US west coast) business hours, and
will still be participating in IRC during that time; important
things should be brought up to me there.

Emergencies should be passed to Arnt Richard Johansen (the LLG
President), Matt Arnold, or Bob LeChevalier, all of whom have my
cell phone number.

(for those of you who are wondering why you care that I'm going to
be unavailable, I run lojban.org)

